  "description": [
    "A highly sulfated linear glycosaminoglycan comprising complex patterns of uronic acid-(1→4)-<small>D</small>-glucosamine repeating subunits. Used as an injectable anticoagulant, it has the highest negative charge density of any known biological molecule."
